    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I run MIRT and received the warning message: <div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">GPFoblq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tmat</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tmat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalize </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalize</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eps </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> maxit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> maxit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  convergence </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> obtained </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">GPFoblq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iterations used</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>I tried to rerun using </div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">MMM </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">AAA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> itemtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;graded&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;QMCEM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> technical </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NCYCLES </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> control </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">maxit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>but I still received the same warning message, apparently it is not modified in the control list?  Thanks!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
