    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Phil,<div><br></div><div>Sometimes, I met exactly same warnings when I try to calculate item fit with bifactorQ rotation.</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><b>Pesudo code,<br></b>itemfit(model, Zh = T, rotate = &#39;bifactorQ&#39;, method = &#39;MAP&#39;, maxit = 1e+5)</blockquote><div><br></div><div>Can I increase maximum iterations in the item fit function or person fit function?</div><div><br></div><div>Seongho</div><div><br>2016년 7월 20일 수요일 오전 2시 27분 1초 UTC+9, Phil Chalmers 님의 말:</div></div>"
    ],
