     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\">\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Jul 28, 2016 at 3:21 PM, Seongho Bae <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">seongh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Phil,<div><br></div><div>Sometimes, I met exactly same warnings when I try to calculate item fit with bifactorQ rotation.</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><b>Pesudo code,<br></b>itemfit(model, Zh = T, rotate = &#39;bifactorQ&#39;, method = &#39;MAP&#39;, maxit = 1e+5)</blockquote><div><br></div><div>Can I increase maximum iterations in the item fit function or person fit function?</div><div><br></div><div>Seongho</div><div><br>2016년 7월 20일 수요일 오전 2시 27분 1초 UTC+9, Phil Chalmers 님의 말:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\">The arguments you want should be passed through summary(), not mirt. mirt() doesn&#39;t care about rotations as they are done post-estimation.</div></span><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Phil</span><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><span>On Tue, Jul 19, 2016 at 5:14 AM, Oce <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">oce....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></span><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\">I run MIRT and received the warning message: <div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">GPFoblq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tmat</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tmat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalize </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalize</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eps </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> maxit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> maxit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  convergence </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> obtained </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">GPFoblq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iterations used</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>I tried to rerun using </div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">MMM </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">AAA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> itemtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;graded&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;QMCEM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> technical </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NCYCLES </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> control </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">maxit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>but I still received the same warning message, apparently it is not modified in the control list?  Thanks!</div></div></span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;mirt-package&quot; group.<br></span>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">mirt-package...@googlegroups.com</a>.<span><br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474940471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23bawgQ1sZrGSa6LQBjE_G\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</span></font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;mirt-package&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mirt-package...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474940471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23bawgQ1sZrGSa6LQBjE_G\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>"
